{"id":"qs5zu5dsi9c46gxb8r91s0us7","title":"二维版本控制在 Roguelike 游戏开发中的应用","originalTitle":"Two Dimensional Version Control","summary":"开发者在参与 r/roguelikedev 夏季活动时，尝试使用 Jujutsu 实现二维版本控制，通过设置一个分支对应一个章节，并自动向前推送更改，实现了同时记录编写者时间和读者章节时间的历史。开发者表示 Jujutsu 有助于灵活修改早期代码，但自动处理带来的复杂性仍需进一步掌握。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://www.redblobgames.com/blog/2026-09-27-jujutsu-experience/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-07T08:21:50.861Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T12:11:48.700Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-07T12:11:48.700Z","category":"cool-repos","tags":["新项目","教程与观点","GitHub"],"score":36,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"7ff582c7-d62e-42a9-bdb1-ce973e752959","title":"开发者尝试用Jujutsu实现Roguelike游戏二维版本控制，自动推送但复杂性待解"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"7ff582c7-d62e-42a9-bdb1-ce973e752959","title":"开发者尝试用Jujutsu实现Roguelike游戏二维版本控制，自动推送但复杂性待解"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"},{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fbO9ZPMQTYuk","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}